OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after 'knives and     
OL,4,Aother weapons' seized from train       
OL,6,FA man has been charged after police    
OL,7,Fseized "knives and other offensive     
OL,8,Fweapons" on a train arriving at        
OL,9,FEdinburgh's Waverley station.          
OL,11,FOfficers from the British Transport    
OL,12,FPolice (BTP) met the LNER service from 
OL,13,FLondon King's Cross at the station at  
OL,14,Fabout 23:00 on Thursday, following     
OL,15,Freports of an assault and a man acting 
OL,16,Fsuspiciously on board.                 
OL,18,FArmy bomb disposal experts were also   
OL,19,Fcalled to the scene following the      
OL,20,Fdiscovery of a suspicious item in a    
OL,21,Frucksack which was later found to be   
OL,22,F"non-hazardous".                       
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
