OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after 'knives and     
OL,4,Aother weapons' seized from train       
OL,6,FA BTP spokesperson said the 38-year-old
OL,7,Fhad been charged with possession of    
OL,8,Foffensive weapons and bladed articles, 
OL,9,Fassault, culpable and reckless conduct 
OL,10,Fand breach of the peace.               
